{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30605","headline":"闻宜春诸举子陪郡主登河梁翫月 · 黄颇","name":"闻宜春诸举子陪郡主登河梁翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年秋半月当空，遥羡飞觞接庾公。\n虹影迥分银汉上，兔辉全写玉筵中。\n笙歌送尽迎寒漏，冰雪吟消永夜风。\n虽向东堂先折桂，不如宾席此时同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄颇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}